# Claims, beliefs and revisions
#
# Who accepts what, and when. Close to CRMinf's I2 Belief and J5 holds to be.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m11_belief> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Claims, beliefs and revisions" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crminf:I2_Belief

iy:Claim a owl:Class .
iy:BeliefRevision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .

iy:content a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:stance a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:heardBy a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:contradicts a owl:ObjectProperty .
